          <h1>Modular Aerobar Positioning System</h1>

          <p class="project-intro">
            Modular aerobar stack redesign for Lidl-Trek WorldTour time trial bikes,
            replacing custom 3D-printed aluminum parts with standardized,
            CNC-machinable components.
          </p>

          <div class="skill-pills">
            <span>SolidWorks</span>
            <span>Mechanical Design</span>
            <span>DFM</span>
            <span>CNC Machining</span>
          </div>

          <div class="project-hero-image">
            <img
              src="assets/pcwttcover.jpg"
              alt="Lidl-Trek rider in wind tunnel testing"
